{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Plan review — Layer-1 clean, LLM layer could not run (server environment)\n\n`review_plan(source=\"local\")` on the plan above:\n\n- **All 11 deterministic checks PASS**, zero blocking, zero advisory, zero coaching, zero\n  indeterminate findings: P1 readiness-shape (5 AC items, 0 empty, clarity 4), P2 resolution\n  (9 references probed, 8 resolved), P3 package-existence, P4 oversize (5322/8000 chars,\n  13 file-impact entries), P5 task-dag, P6 ac-quality (0 citation gaps, 0 provenance gaps),\n  P7 destructive-sniff (no hits), P8 reviewability (1353/868000 tokens), P9 file-impact-coverage\n  (13, applicable), P10 verification-presence (3 qualifying AC items), P11 ac-vagueness (0 vague).\n- **Verdict INDETERMINATE, unsigned**, solely because the LLM layer did not run:\n  `\"llm_unavailable\": true`, `\"llm_error\": \"a bedrock model/provider is configured but the\n  optional bedrock provider package is not installed: pip install 'pydantic-ai-slim[bedrock]'\"`.\n  That is an environment fault on the MCP server host, not a finding against this plan.\n\nTwo further environment notes from the same attempt, recorded so the next session does not\nre-derive them:\n\n- `review_plan` with the DEFAULT `source=\"attested\"` fails outright:\n  `cannot resolve ref 'origin/main' to a commit in '.'` — and the same for an explicit full SHA.\n  The primary checkout resolves `origin/main` to `269f7b49c44f` fine, so the MCP server process\n  is rooted somewhere that is not that repo. `source=\"local\"` is the working path today.\n- `claim` succeeded WITHOUT a signed attestation and WITHOUT any force override, so the\n  plan-review claim gate is not enforcing on this project at present.\n\n**No force override was used anywhere in this session.**\n"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787859701914721166,"uuid":"bfd3a0aa-a3aa-4f0a-a230-d0d79c602512"}